{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>美國人工智能公司Anthropic，首日於納斯達克掛牌。</p><p></p><p>Anthropic將向參與承銷的華爾街銀行支付5.5億美元費用，高於SpaceX向承銷銀行支付的金額。據Anthropic向美國證券交易委員會提交的最新文件，公司同意由高盛和摩根士丹利為首的承銷銀行支付約百分之0.67的承銷費用，超過SpaceX向銀行支付的5億美元。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_JF.ANTHROPIC.LISTING.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026ySigYNQQ7A1795107885.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>另外，《彭博》引述知情人士透露，約有1,200家機構投資者提交Anthropic新股認購，超過一半未獲配任何股份。相當一部分來自美國境外的認購，未獲配股。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:44.562270+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":241,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T16:16:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:20.094948+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T17:54:59.241102+00:00","content_hash":"01946d7b3d30772c5338867c86f105a83754f703472dc94e5c1046bcfb48684a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-19T18:01:44.562270+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}